# Naming And Components

- Constants and enums: ALL_CAPS style (`PROGRAM_TYPE`, `API_BASE_URL`)
- Interfaces / classes / structs: PascalCase
- Put constants, enums, and models in dedicated folders; import where used
- Components: single responsibility, typically 70–200 lines
- Prefer shared UI pieces over one-off duplicated layouts